=== str-ord-minus-ord
from: IDNA::Punycode 1.0.1 lib/IDNA/Punycode.rakumod:14
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: call ord
--- code
sub digit($code) {
    return ord($code) - ord("A")      if $code ~~ /<[A..Z]>/;
    return ord($code) - ord("a")      if $code ~~ /<[a..z]>/;
    ord($code) - 22
}
say <A z 0 9>.map(&digit);
--- expect
(0 25 26 35)

