=== str-ords-loop-validate
from: MCP::Server 0.7.0 lib/MCP/Server/HTTP/Validation.rakumod:39
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method ords
--- code
sub valid($value) {
    for $value.ords -> $ord {
        return False if $ord < 0x20 || $ord == 0x7F;
    }
    True
}
say valid('plain text');
say valid("tab\there");
--- expect
True
False

